      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Moderate cold rolling followed by optimized annealing will refine the grains and create abundant deformation-induced nanotwins in the target alloy.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Twin boundaries can obstruct dislocation motion and thereby strengthen an alloy.",
