      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5321736::webcard",
        "PMC8249401::webcard"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "A hierarchical twin network can retain pathways for dislocation glide while providing twin-boundary strengthening.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5321736::webcard"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Nanotwins and refined grain boundaries will act as barriers to crack initiation and propagation in the target alloy.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5321736::webcard"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed microstructure will improve load transfer and make the stress distribution more homogeneous.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Introducing nanotwins will increase the alloy's yield strength.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5321736::webcard",
        "PMC8249401::webcard"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Introducing nanotwins will increase the alloy's ductility.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5321736::webcard"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Introducing nanotwins and grain refinement will increase the alloy's fracture resistance and reduce crack formation.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5321736::webcard"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The thermo-mechanical intervention does not alter the alloy's elemental composition.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preserving composition while changing only microstructural length scales will leave the caloric phase transition intact.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The processed alloy will retain a caloric entropy change within about 10% of the unprocessed alloy.",
